		(uuid "bb259a92-f992-4ca5-af06-768482456d1e")
	)
	(text "TC2030-CTX-NL external cable; board footprint is a zero-height contact pattern, not a purchased fitted header.\nTop PCB map: 1 VTref, 2 SWDIO, 3 nRESET, 4 SWCLK, 5 GND, 6 SWO (optional)."
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7237f673-b1e7-405c-b4b5-daaf6a226bcd")
	)
	(text "Manufacturer Rev B: 6 copper/mask contacts, NO PASTE, 3 unnumbered NPTH alignment holes.\nActual cable contact face is mirrored relative to PCB top. One alignment hole versus paired holes keys orientation.\nNo tracks/vias in central shaded keepout; no other signal within 0.020 inch (0.508 mm) of any contact.\nStock footprint does not encode those routing rules or full cable mating/access envelope."
		(at 25.4 130.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7198cdc3-9ea9-4287-bb19-ec2dbb28c8d7")
	)
	(text "All six fixture terminals intentionally unwired; no fake NC flags or source flags.\nMain EPS and historical package evidence remain frozen. No real SWD protection circuit is implemented here."
		(at 25.4 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9aafc8b1-acc3-48d2-b7aa-95820a69f208")
	)
	(text "External cable: TC2030-CTX-NL\nNo purchased part fitted to PCB.\nStock pin1 VCC = probe VTref only."
		(at 152.4 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "229e939f-d8f4-4073-87d4-b6da6626f853")
	)
	(text "CUSTOM — REVIEW REQUIRED: U1A–U1E TMUX1511PWR review candidate\nConstruction authorized; bidirectional SPST: SEL HIGH closes S ↔ D; LOW opens. Body color unsupported; green callout alternative."
		(at 25.4 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
				(color 0 255 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bb57c40a-1bae-4561-bf3c-b7712ecdd35b")
	)
	(text "U1: TI PW14 top-view pin1 upper-left, CCW; no EP / NC / mechanical lead. 14 raw copper/paste/mask pads.\nStock generic land differs from TI example; reserve >=7.70 x5.90mm for worst flash + clearance. Full mechanical / assembly / circuit qualification OPEN."
		(at 25.4 238.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e752a482-9932-45b3-988e-3d83d567d164")
	)
  (text "TI supply-good candidate\nRESET2 independent of MCU NRST.\nThreshold2.857..2.974V;29mVhysTYP.\nRelease120..350ms;assert20usTYP ONLY.\nStockland / fullflash / collapse gates OPEN."
